iv class="card"><h2>Security & Data Safety</h2><p>Passwords are stored as hashes. Branch access is enforced server-side. Database backups must be stored outside the public web directory and protected with restricted access. Do not share backup files or production credentials.</p><p>For backup and restore instructions, see <code>docs/deployment-and-backup.md</code>.</p></div></main></body></html>